title: ONGOING List items that look like headings are lost.
pid: b276b94c-404e-46e3-8082-217b87ce5e3f
body: |2-
  A Markdown list item at column 0 (* [Does it use plaintext?…] in FAQ.md)
  is now a line starting with * , which Org reads as a top-level heading.
  This breaks FAQ.org's outline.
  The exporter warned about this and similar lines (#+begin_src, #+title)
  but wrote them anyway.
